"</td>"
"\n"
"</tr>"
"\n"
"</table>"
"\n"
"</p>"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
"<table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"10\" align=\"center\">\n"
"<tr>\n"
"<td>\n"
"<img src=\"hicolor/32x32/apps/kipi.png\">\n"
"</td>"
"\n"
"<td>\n"
"Weetst Du al, dat sik mit de KIPI-Bibliotheek en Schirmfoto opnehmen lett, un dat sik dat Resultaat mit en poor Kommentaren na en Album sekern lett?\n"
"</td>"
"\n"
"</tr>"
"\n"
"</table>"
"\n"
"</p>"
"\n"

#. +> trunk
#: tips.cpp:67
msgid ""
